#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:453
msgid "Site-wide switch. Turn off to hide the GARAN label everywhere, even for products set up to show it. Set the manufacturer guarantee per product under Product data → EU Guarantee."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:458
msgid "Show a \"Your legal guarantee rights\" sentence in the site header, on every page"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:459
msgid "Automatically added as a menu item next to Home / Cart / Checkout — in the desktop, tablet, and mobile navigation alike. The harmonised legal-guarantee notice appears in a small preview on mouse roll-over, and in full on click or tap. Falls back to a standalone banner if no navigation menu can be resolved."
msgstr ""

