#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:478
msgid "Short text line with a link that opens the notice graphic"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:479
msgid "Short text line, with the notice graphic sent as a file attachment"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-eggl-settings.php:481
msgid "\"Full notice graphic\" is embedded directly in the email so it still shows if the recipient's mail client blocks remote images by default. \"Short text line\" keeps the email compact — the link opens the same official notice graphic in a new tab instead. \"Attachment\" keeps that same short text line but attaches the official notice graphic to the email as a file instead of linking or embedding it."
msgstr ""

